22	 * The stand-in provider under the {@code mock-fx} profile would serve a rate, but it picks
23	 * its own and fails at a configured probability, and neither is a thing a test can assert a
24	 * converted amount against. This one is quoted at, so the credited figure in the response is
25	 * checkable by hand.
