94		 * transaction, so anything longer would be telling a client to sit out an operation that
95		 * has already finished. Nothing in the design fixes a value, and this is the honest
96		 * reading of what the operation costs rather than a policy.
97		 */
98		private static final String RETRY_AFTER_SECONDS = "1";
